      "content": "that's exactly what i was thinking. it's terrifying. once i finish a call, i feel like i'm being watched or recorded through the light itself. if they really are using these pulses to send data, how would i even stop it? is there a way to block those specific frequencies or should i just rip them all out of the house?",
